  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Reframes the app around coding-agent usage rather than OpenCode alone\n- Adds live OpenCode-backed overview, model breakdown, and usage history\n- Adds deterministic simulated mode for demos, screenshots, and regression checks\n- Makes tool-source provenance explicit, with `TBD` placeholders for planned Codex CLI and Hermes adapters\n- Improves tooltip, focus, and model-breakdown accessibility behavior\n- Hardens rendering and test isolation, and switches the project to a reproducible `uv` setup\n- Adds GitHub Actions CI for `uv sync`, unit tests, and Python compile verification\n\n## Validation\n\n- `uv run python -m unittest tests.test_app tests.test_readme -v`\n- `python3 -m py_compile app.py scripts/snapshot_dashboard.py`\n- `curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8322/api/overview`\n- `curl -fsS 'http://127.0.0.1:8322/api/overview?simulate=1'`\n- Live UI check on `http://127.0.0.1:8322/`\n- GitHub Actions CI passing on this PR\n",
